29
00:04:36,980 --> 00:04:44,197
Three options for that departure — all eight hundred and sixty-nine miles and low at this hour. I take the recommended DIRECT line.

30
00:04:44,247 --> 00:04:51,354
Acceptance is a human click: the system never starts a voyage by itself. The vessel then moves along the accepted geometry at the

31
00:04:51,404 --> 00:04:58,732
