33
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:16,594
There it is — ROUTE REVIEW REQUIRED. The re-assessment found medium severity on the remaining route, which breaks the ceiling the operator set.

34
00:05:16,644 --> 00:05:23,993
It names the primary factor, and it pauses. It does not reroute on its own. I ask for alternatives from our current position,

35
00:05:24,043 --> 00:05:32,399
