37
00:05:53,400 --> 00:06:00,845
For the finale, a repeatable drill. It simulates exactly one fact — iceberg D23 ungrounding and drifting a hundred

38
00:06:00,895 --> 00:06:08,274
kilometres north, into our corridor — and every route, every risk number and every corridor radius is computed by

39
00:06:08,324 --> 00:06:15,769
